* sgen.lib - 3-terminal fixed ~2kHz sine generator subcircuit for ngspice
* Pins:  Vp  Vn  Out
* Topology: RC phase-shift oscillator (Q1) + emitter-follower buffer (Q2).
.subckt sgen vp vm out
* --- common-emitter gain stage (bias to ground-referenced emitter) ---
Rcol1 vp nc1 4.7k
Q1 nc1 nb1 ne1 2N3904
Re_up ne1 ne1b 68
Re_down ne1b 0 910
Ce1 ne1b 0 100u
Rb1a vp nb1 300k
Rb1b nb1 0 47k
* --- 3-stage RC phase-shift ladder (sets f ~= 1.9 kHz, feeds Q1 base) ---
Cps1 nc1 nps1 2.5n
Rps1 nps1 0 10k
Cps2 nps1 nps2 2.5n
Rps2 nps2 0 10k
Cps3 nps2 nb1 2.5n
* --- emitter-follower output buffer (low Zout, stiff enough to drive 100R) ---
Cc1 nc1 nbuf_a 1u
Rbuf_series nbuf_a nbuf 10k
Rbin nbuf 0 6.8k
Q2 vp nbuf ne2 2N3904
Re2 ne2 vm 680
* --- AC-couple to ground-referenced output, small series R ---
Cout ne2 nout_ac 22u
Rout nout_ac out 10
Rbleed out 0 10k
.ends sgen
